    Bug 2030855 - Overwrite some background nova tokens with our CSS tokens. r=Paenglab,rtaylor




    - Open the Settings tab.
    - Scroll down and click on the button `Advanced Config`.
    - Add the `browser.design-tokens.nova` preferences and set it to `true`.
    - Without this patch, the Settings, Account Settings, and Add-ons page should have a purple background in light mode.
    - With this patch, our layout colors should be used and no purple tint should be visible.

    #### Extra fixes introduced

    - Use the same `aboutExtra.css` file to override all the about:* pages coming from Firefox.
    - Improved the style of the settings button in the Add-ons tab.
    - Removed borders from the sidebars that can't be resized.
    - Added our sidebar background color to all sidebars.
    - Removed the responsive collapse of sidebar in about:* pages.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293413

